# Testing & Git

## Manual API test
```cmd
cd backend
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File test_endpoints_manual.ps1 -SkipSlow
```

## Automated
```cmd
python run_tests.py --verbose
pytest test_complete.py -v
```

## Before push
- Never stage `backend/.env` or secrets
- Confirm `backend/models/*.joblib` if classifier needed
- Backend branch for FYP repo: `Backend_sakoon_Ai` → `sakoon` remote

## Git remotes
- `origin` — personal Proj repo
- `sakoon` — https://github.com/moin-ud-din-zafar/sakoon-ai-fyp.git

Do not force-push `main` without explicit user request.
